cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Carrying Mechanic workbench: a selection instrument and workbench for traditional games"
abstract: >-
  Software for deciding, before any adaptation exists, which documented traditional games are
  supported for a digital or hybrid interface. A language model drafts a structured record for each
  game with a quotation for every judgement, a person decides every field, and eligibility is
  computed by rule. Contains the instrument (v0.5), the record schema, the workbench, the evaluation
  code, the test suite and a synthetic corpus. The encyclopaedia entries and the coded records are
  not included.
